  "finalText": "I've cancelled the wireless mouse on order O-2003 and refunded $73.50 to Marcus's card. The rest of the order is unchanged and will ship as planned.\n\n1. **Checked first:** O-2003 belongs to C-200. The mouse is line L1 (product P-MOU, 2 units) and it hadn't shipped. It wasn't backordered either, so stock had been set aside for it.\n2. **Cancelled:** only line L1.\n3. **Refunded:** $73.50 to his card (refund RF-1, tied to line L1). The order used the MOUSE25 discount, so he paid $73.50 for that line instead of the $98.00 list price, and the refund matches what he paid.\n4. **Stock:** I put both mice back on the shelf. Wireless Mouse stock went from 30 to 32.\n\nWhen I checked the order again afterwards, line L1 showed as cancelled and refunded. The USB hub (L2, $69.00) and the 3 cables (L3, $57.00) are still waiting to ship, and the shipping address hasn't changed.",
